### ============================================
### Task API Test File
### Works with REST Client VS Code extension
### ============================================

### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000
@taskId = 1

### ============================================
### 1. CREATE A NEW TASK
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Complete the NestJS backend"
}

###

### ============================================
### 2. CREATE ANOTHER TASK
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Write API documentation"
}

###

### ============================================
### 3. CREATE TASK WITH LONG TITLE
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "This is a very long task title that might exceed the character limit if we set one"
}

###

### ============================================
### 4. CREATE TASK - MISSING TITLE (Should fail)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": ""
}

###

### ============================================
### 5. CREATE TASK - EMPTY BODY (Should fail)
### ============================================
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{}

###

### ============================================
### 6. MARK TASK AS COMPLETE
### (Replace 1 with your actual task ID)
### ============================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1/complete

###

### ============================================
### 7. MARK ANOTHER TASK AS COMPLETE
### ============================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/2/complete

###

### ============================================
### 8. MARK TASK - INVALID ID (Should fail - 404)
### ============================================
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/999/complete

###

### ============================================
### 9. GET ALL TASKS (If you added this endpoint)
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks

###

### ============================================
### 10. GET A SPECIFIC TASK (If you added this endpoint)
### ============================================
GET {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1

###

### ============================================
### 11. COMPLETE FLOW TEST - Create and Complete
### ============================================
### Step 1: Create a task
POST {{baseUrl}}/tasks
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Test task for complete flow"
}

### Store the task ID from response
### Step 2: Mark it complete
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/tasks/1/complete

###
